OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fcloudy start to the evening but heavy
OL,7,Frain and hill snow soon spreading
OL,8,Feastwards and continuing overnight.
OL,9,FThe snow falling to lower levels for a
OL,10,Ftime. Windy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FRain and hill snow clearing to
OL,13,Fthe east for many through the morning
OL,14,Fbut slower to clear east coast,
OL,15,Flingering through the afternoon.
OL,16,FFurther west turning drier with bright
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
